                "comment": "Completely unclear with expectations and gives very vague descriptions for all assignments including weekly projects. A significant portion of the grade is petty and unnecessary (notes from assigned readings, subjective rating on participation in class). Puts down any student that attempts to participate and offer their opinion.",
