                "quality_rating": 2
            },
            {
                "comment": "Expectations for the course are clearly not given, the course talks about transparency in health care system and she can't even make grading expectations in her own designed course transparent. The course is also taught on the flipped learning model, however assignments and readings are done after the her lecture so students end up doing poorly.",
